{"script":"yd_015_03","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]你问我是什么类型的魔人？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]看看我的鹿茸和蹄子，你应该就能明白了吧。[r]不过，我理解你的困惑，毕竟不是所有魔人都拥有如此显著的特征。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我现在的姿态，是长年修行自然之道、与黑森林之灵高度共鸣的结果。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]森林之灵赐予我们丰裕的收成，让灵魂有所归依，而我们则以最诚挚的侍奉回报她。[r]这样的姿态，也是森林的恩赐。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]换句话说……这正是黑森林与森林住民在这数百年间维持的珍贵和谐。[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara015_2_face_chara015_1e","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":-120,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-474,"img":"chara015_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"芭杜尔-友善3"}